flowchart LR
    A[Report interval reached] --> B[Refresh GPU-side<br/>metric summaries]
    B --> C[Read compact export<br/>data to host]
    C --> D[Write config, stats,<br/>species, and genome artifacts]
    D --> E[Discover valid<br/>run directories]
    E --> F[Group runs<br/>by condition]
    F --> G[Generate plots and<br/>representative genome views]
    G --> H[Render self-contained<br/>HTML report]
